///  * ```
///  *    +---------------+
///  *    |               |
///  * +--> uninitialized +---> rcl_get_zero_initialized_context() +
///  * |  |               |                                        |
///  * |  +---------------+                                        |
///  * |                                                           |
///  * |           +-----------------------------------------------+
