///  * |  +--------v---------+                +-----------------------+
///  * |  |                  |                |                       |
///  * |  | zero-initialized +-> rcl_init() +-> initialized and valid +-> rcl_shutdown() +
///  * |  |                  |                |                       |                  |
///  * |  +------------------+                +-----------------------+                  |
///  * |                                                                                 |
///  * |               +-----------------------------------------------------------------+
///  * |               |
///  * |  +------------v------------+
